  Filled counterpart of ic_logout, for Settings rows only.

  The outline original is still there and still correct everywhere else. These exist
  because a 2dp stroke inside a 32dp coloured tile turns to mush: the stroke is a fixed
  width but the tile shrank, so the glyph loses its counters and reads as a white smudge.
  A solid shape has no such problem and is what the reference uses in the same place.

  Geometry is original work on a 24x24 grid, not traced from any shipping icon set.
-->
